 "sentences": [
  "Martha Bradley wrote a thousand-page cookbook.",
  "She worked as a cook for over 30 years in Bath.",
  "Her massive book, The British Housewife, was released in 1756.",
  "It came out as a 42-issue partwork over several months.",
  "Bradley likely died before her own work was even published.",
  "She famously used French techniques instead of traditional British styles.",
  "This huge book wasn't reprinted until 1996."
